WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.040
1923 is shrouded in secrecy. But to all the&nbsp;
Yellowstone fans waiting for a glimpse into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.901
the latest installment of the Dutton family&nbsp;
saga, here's everything we know so far.

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:12.780
According to The Hollywood Reporter,&nbsp;
1923 was commissioned following the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:17.258
success of both Yellowstone and 1883,&nbsp;
all but confirming that Paramount+ sees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.258 --> 00:00:21.000
Taylor Sheridan's tapestry of family&nbsp;
and power as a flagship franchise.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:28.578
"That land is mine, and no&nbsp;
one can sell it but me."

00:00:28.578 --> 00:00:33.480
THR had previously suggested that 1883 would&nbsp;receive an additional batch of episodes but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:36.649
Sheridan has since corrected the&nbsp;
record, clarifying to Deadline,

00:00:39.861 --> 00:00:43.860
In 1923, we'll see the early years of&nbsp;
the 20th century throw life-altering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:47.220
curveballs at the Dutton family. The&nbsp;
series promises to be an insightful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.715
look at Yellowstone ranch's humble beginnings.

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:54.960
Taylor Sheridan's 1923 will debut&nbsp;
on December 18, 2022 on Paramount+&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:00.540
in the U.S. and Canada. Viewers in the U.K. and&nbsp;Australia can catch the episode on December 19.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:04.380
"There's a rawness to the west that&nbsp;
still reflects where we came from."

00:01:04.787 --> 00:01:09.180
The premiere will also run on cable's Paramount&nbsp;Network immediately following Episode 7 of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:13.200
latest season of Yellowstone. The second&nbsp;episode of 1923 will hit the Paramount&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:19.260
Network on January 1, 2023. It remains to be seen&nbsp;if the rest of 1923 will air on the cable channel.

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:24.480
1923 will consist of eight episodes and&nbsp;
is expected to run for two seasons. It's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:28.620
not known if both seasons will take place&nbsp;in 1923, or if there will be a time jump.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:33.960
Like Yellowstone and 1883, Taylor Sheridan's&nbsp;upcoming prequel series will focus on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:38.256
infamous Dutton family as they continue to expand&nbsp;their reach and power in the state of Montana.

00:01:38.256 --> 00:01:42.420
"You know, the first Duttons to settle&nbsp;
this valley, fighting was all they knew.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:45.529
It's how they got here. How they&nbsp;
kept the land once they did."

00:01:45.529 --> 00:01:49.380
This time, the Dutton ancestors include&nbsp;
Jacob Dutton, the grizzled old patriarch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:53.040
of the Yellowstone ranch. Jacob is the&nbsp;
brother of James, who was played by Tim&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:57.780
McGraw in 1883. Jacob Dutton is joined on&nbsp;screen by his loyal, headstrong wife Cara.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.960
1923 explores the early days of the Yellowstone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:04.980
making it abundantly clear that John Dutton&nbsp;III and his family have it easy compared to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:09.300
the challenges their ancestors faced. Viewers&nbsp;will experience some of the 20th century's key&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:13.020
events through the eyes of the Duttons.&nbsp;
An official plot synopsis confirmed that,

00:02:22.079 --> 00:02:26.220
1923 will be the most star-studded series&nbsp;in the Yellowstone universe to date.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:29.340
"You ever wonder what this&nbsp;
place looked like before any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.133
of us were here?"

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:31.980
"All the time." 

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:37.260
The show is led by Harrison Ford, who is making&nbsp;his television debut as Jacob Dutton. In a Vanity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:41.160
Fair interview, Ford describes Jacob as a man&nbsp;who has no choice but to focus on survival.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.740
Ford went on to describe the&nbsp;
Dutton struggles, saying:

00:02:51.416 --> 00:02:55.400
"What an embarrassment we are to the&nbsp;
sacrifice it took to give us a home."

00:02:55.400 --> 00:03:00.600
Helen Mirren plays Cara Dutton, Jacob's wife. By&nbsp;all accounts, the two seem to still be in love,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:04.860
even after 40 years of marriage. But while Jacob&nbsp;is the archetype of the all-American cowboy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:10.403
Cara is more nuanced. Mirren's Cara speaks&nbsp;with an Irish accent. She told Vanity Fair,

00:03:12.112 --> 00:03:16.920
Other 1923 cast members include Supernatural&nbsp;actor Sebastian Roché as Father Renaud,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:21.960
the principal of a Native American school. The&nbsp;Departed actor James Badge Dale plays Jacob's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:26.520
right-hand man, John Dutton Sr. John's&nbsp;
wife Emma is played by Marley Shelton,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:31.920
last seen in 2022's Scream. Robert Patrick, who&nbsp;recently played the White Dragon in Peacemaker,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:35.760
will play Sheriff William McDowell.&nbsp;
And rounding out the cast is Timothy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:40.913
Dalton as Donald Whitfield, playing a character&nbsp;described only as "intimidating and nefarious."

00:03:40.913 --> 00:03:45.420
There's a brief teaser trailer for 1923&nbsp;
that clocks in at just under 30 seconds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:49.860
This first look at the series paints early&nbsp;
20th century Montana as an unforgiving state.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:53.400
The trailer kicks off with an&nbsp;
unidentified female narrator saying,

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.943
"Violence has always haunted this family."

00:03:55.943 --> 00:03:59.340
She goes on to say violence has followed&nbsp;the Dutton family all the way "from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.380
Scottish highlands and the slums of Dublin."

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:06.120
A young man is seen fallen off his horse,&nbsp;reaching for a gun. Then soldiers fill the screen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:10.620
making it clear that war will feature in the&nbsp;story. World War I ended five years earlier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:15.420
in 1918, but was surely not far from&nbsp;
the memories of its veterans. 1883&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:19.080
fans will remember Tom Hanks' cameo&nbsp;
in a Civil War flashback on that show.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:23.280
Viewers catch a glimpse of a dour Jacob&nbsp;Dutton on horseback. And more battle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:26.820
scenes are intercut with shots of Jacob,&nbsp;
wearing a sheriff's star, and the rest of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:31.500
the Dutton clan together. Helen Mirren's Cara&nbsp;Dutton is a fighter, too. She's seen bloodied,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:36.420
pointing a shotgun at someone cowering on the&nbsp;ground. From the looks of things, 1923 is going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.138
to be just as suspenseful and action-packed&nbsp;
as 1883, in true Taylor Sheridan style.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.700
Those who want to catch up on Taylor&nbsp;
Sheridan's Yellowstone franchise before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:49.620
the debut of 1923 may need to subscribe to a&nbsp;variety of streaming services. Yellowstone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:53.280
the heart of the franchise, is currently&nbsp;
airing its fifth season on Paramount Network,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:58.560
with new episodes released weekly in the U.S.&nbsp;Seasons 1 to 4 can be watched on Peacock.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:03.600
Viewers who want to stream Season 5 can do so&nbsp;via the Paramount Network. Fans can also catch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:08.820
up on the series via DirecTV if you want to catch&nbsp;all those lighthearted Beth moments we all love.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.040
"I believe in loving with your whole soul.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:16.020
And destroying anything that&nbsp;
wants to kill what you love."

00:05:16.804 --> 00:05:21.180
In Canada, Seasons 1 to 4 of Yellowstone are&nbsp;available to stream on Amazon Prime Video,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:25.920
and Season 5 episodes are released weekly.&nbsp;All 5 seasons of Yellowstone are available on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:30.540
Paramount+ in the United Kingdom. Viewers from&nbsp;around the world can also purchase individual&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:35.040
seasons through their favorite digital services,&nbsp;like Apple TV, the Google Play Store, and Amazon.

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:40.620
1883 is available to stream on Paramount+ wherever&nbsp;the service is available, including the U.S.,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:46.020
Canada, and the U.K, and now is a perfect time&nbsp;to catch up on the drama before 1923 arrives.

